Best Practices Développement Parallèle
Workflow quotidien :

bash
# Nouvelle feature
git checkout develop
git pull origin develop
git checkout -b feature/missions-ocr
# ... dev ...
git push origin feature/missions-ocr
# PR vers develop → tests → merge

# Hotfix urgent production
git checkout main
git checkout -b hotfix/auth-bypass
# ... fix ...
git push origin hotfix/auth-bypass
# PR vers main ET develop
Règles d'or :

Ne jamais dev directement sur main ou develop

Beta = develop branch, Production = main branch

Hotfixes mergés dans les deux branches
​

